"The Qiskit SDK lets you create custom transpilation passes and run them in the `PassManager` object or add them to a `StagedPassManager`. Here we will demonstrate how to write a  transpiler pass, focusing on building a pass that performs [Pauli twirling](https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0606161) on the noisy quantum gates in a quantum circuit. This example uses the DAG, which is the object manipulated by the `TransformationPass` type of pass.\n"
msgstr ""

